data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7594535768023499550\",\n        \"text\": \"I was accused of COCSA. I have zero memory of it. I apologize to the victim and said I apologize for any and all hurt I caused, even if I didn’t remember. This was all as adults, I was forgiven and now years later I’ve been outcasted by family and victim. It’s hard to take accountability for events I have no idea happened or have zero recollection of. My victim has done other bad things to me as well that now has made me okay with the no contact between us. It’s unfortunate but I’m on my own because of actions I have no memory of and already apologized and owned up for. I hope everyone heals\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-12T17:58:08.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 421,\n        \"replyCount\": 6,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"kind.ghostie\",\n          \"displayName\": \"K ✨\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/7352816278739877931~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=702c7dde&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=LlHxiTUjWsWmMGgpJEJC9fVyDCE%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"150909121054019584\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAANg0U5L_ov3RjyeIjk3Hk4rRYEft6Md6uCw6yb9KPVbvC4bpblZNi0WvOianP86eb\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7664479920744448786\",\n        \"text\": \"I did it to my brother, we were young and I regret it to this day I don’t know why I did it and I will never forgive myself.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-20T05:36:54.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 68,\n        \"replyCount\": 4,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"yogiallyamare\",\n          \"displayName\": \"yogially\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/11d480f6e02876f4324bd1ed232d8eb7~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=9fcd59ca&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=XfTI8XpTgFWohW7So6n4K0P77gQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7142278874755220486\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAQ5eBDKom9CipWycM8ezDsAT_WXKtrM2m067e9-ktNCfycZxoUm4MVWRcFEuj0GXR\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7577415525601559327\",\n        \"text\": \"I don’t wanna see any hate to this. She came out and was fully honest. She didn’t say anything to excuse her actions. This is pure honesty. Thank you for sharing your story.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-11-27T14:42:40.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 373,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"hjdonbnnet6\",\n          \"displayName\": \"~𝓕𝓘𝓢𝓗𝓨~\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/3c92fe761e78c80e6a0ec36659b43c78~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=aa37c218&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Uwu6DNSz6zLzO%2FO2T3t%2F90sDHb8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7549801577943778359\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAeFwkM3Xh6M6dA0u9vgA_xfBRaTRy7-qhnVjSFo-eZkL8pINTl-PjCODAhULS3V4T\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7439022757432017706\",\n        \"text\": \"It absolutely amazing that you are taking COMPLETE ACCOUNTABILITY! Thank you so much for that💖 I never received that as a child from the person who touched me. This is everything for survivors 🥰\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-19T16:08:01.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 547,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"shaaa1994\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Aysjaaa\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/42a317376ae150cd3a94d32bbd71fa75~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=2acc3f46&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=SvTfutW2In1BzrK5E9piswcuJNw%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6822723708223669253\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAH71vqwqG-k5qAB0tVFu6ZkOsD1JwVp66uMf2ia1LzhNQt6QwYeQwcSveKATc3rxE\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7664479309230490386\",\n        \"text\": \"I did it as a child and I have always regretted it deeply and still do I wish I never did it\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-20T05:34:20.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 30,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"yogiallyamare\",\n          \"displayName\": \"yogially\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/11d480f6e02876f4324bd1ed232d8eb7~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=9fcd59ca&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=XfTI8XpTgFWohW7So6n4K0P77gQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7142278874755220486\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAQ5eBDKom9CipWycM8ezDsAT_WXKtrM2m067e9-ktNCfycZxoUm4MVWRcFEuj0GXR\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7439021341892231966\",\n        \"text\": \"I really appreciate your approach to taking accountability and honesty in sharing this story.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-19T16:02:24.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 232,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"rissssssssssy29\",\n          \"displayName\": \"evonne💗\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/d77814f59008589a5f525d8a948b9b94~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=2d30f3cc&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Ei9tDKjIISVpUuEQU90LL%2BLpDY8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7277606189487162410\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAJd25GD3bBdvQWGRw_Si6NSdO3c5jcdTGgCjZn8zpjwA1W8hKF0ShCaO4GfP3cfXC\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7645707485441262366\",\n        \"text\": \"You are incredibly brave to share something so vulnerable.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-30T15:30:24.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 27,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"emilysherwood5\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Dr. Emily Sherwood\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/3dfe0cde476b63a612bf673575db4cf5~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=74149b72&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Bii1PzX7EdEcNyISKVgWF6jf0mo%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7601957658414285838\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAcBKOAJ6PFAj3wHNKIbMTHpTcLhWunLHRiNs4wFB7HhJBO3xE7dWjm-tOi9FoXyCx\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7439083868631122731\",\n        \"text\": \"Thank you for owning up to this\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-19T20:05:18.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 189,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"megatronbt\",\n          \"displayName\": \"JermaineUser2711\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/2a8941426b15c2a34d1d04e8eba4a54c~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=27cb6344&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=DR3lTaauqBY%2BeEl6zVYwgA7NcCA%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6892994578366907397\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAxqdxducrUqlltzAdtIB5FzP0c_6eXQeLlo_I_5Vy3KBEF3L1_dU9Pna2rI3CcWXj\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7604247109025497869\",\n        \"text\": \"As a victim of this. Thank you for talking about this, it’s healing.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-02-07T22:02:49.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 46,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"deboopdeboop7\",\n          \"displayName\": \"deboopdeboop\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/musically-maliva-obj/1594805258216454~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=c043984f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=N6aGIRwjGaTIxlykkM%2FXo5BweKM%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7511910955473011755\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAARAAhZ65jO5o-LZM2x8kxTWX_JMtDUQYunNnfEpHGlukjvD2jRtk4xl1slLOlCbJa\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7446151894395568928\",\n        \"text\": \"Thank you for being so open about this. COCSA happened to me, my sis & male cousin by relatives - who denied all knowledge.The 3 of us validating our experiences, speaking to mum & aunt about this\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-12-08T21:12:31.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 108,\n        \"replyCount\": 2,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"andria_bobbles\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Ria ✨️✨️\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast2a-avt-0068-euttp/5bf44f49503979b1c19ed713813c10bb~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=d2b4fc3c&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=bsVfYLWxhh1zOKBE5GCQx2LRUs8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6879814289726735365\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAEiN4ITn3fhdAJ1zItJ86cLd33p_r2mt2dFGsAv4o31iiVYp4Ac0nZVlVwvGryA-K\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7577885012218643231\",\n        \"text\": \"wow this is deep and the amount of introspection and accountability is refreshing as sad as this all is.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-11-28T21:04:37.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 101,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"natalieneedsabreak\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Natalie J.\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/7043990849901821998~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=8cb9d11c&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=N56D%2FjE%2B1Hh74Q5fUqjqbAwnJuQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7043990003140199429\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAqYvtLYQ17KAclNLdaFzKFqeRGgih-vKN0k615A4M6a-0ExQlXi96Gh5F-3SxteWt\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7601513554866275093\",\n        \"text\": \"I was also the one that did it. I was curious I didn't understand, my female friends didn't understand. I didn't intend to cause harm, I only found out years and years later that it was wrong. I apologized to all of them, they apologized to me. We are still friends today.\\nAnd I didn't get out of it unscathed, I didn't know my identity for years, I was bi, then omni. Now I am finally okay and I can finally move on, they have moved on. It is not always that this happens on purpose.\\nYears later I was also a victim. Unfortunately things like this happen💔\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-31T13:15:06.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 110,\n        \"replyCount\": 5,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"amy.as.awesome.as.always\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Amelia Reneé\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-avt-0068/57efe9d528b2cc9810d876e9d7cd91a5~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=196abccb&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=mRqYzw4fpAGzzsCgpOxZR36DKUA%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6597445265316134917\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAk69a7OnSCEreVNzHnEV-wQdeC-9t2I6Vq7cEgPOARd8qSilkT5cez8dlmTJYS0G6\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7439111245485966126\",\n        \"text\": \"I'm sorry that happened to you. it literally ruined my life.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-19T21:51:16.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 62,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"mysticinspires\",\n          \"displayName\": \"MysticInspirations&Artistry\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/6566a5e32d4a49b327a7874b79788207~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=6278d632&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=AS%2Fnwfpx8jdeAgad9IlsM84miHo%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7401108175481242667\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAyOJ7z5I1T1PGgFCyKmHCB4ZzRyIl3H_RY1bxI328FTqRpa6Zw2lTtA7cumGIbdgi\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7449754128928391943\",\n        \"text\": \"I will never understand why my mother kept taking me to sleepovers with someone who did this to me. I was never okay afterwards. It is so healing to hear this from you, and I am so, so grateful 💖\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-12-18T14:10:53.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 39,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"tarotcartel\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Cartel Queen\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-avt-0068/0816ff25cce884c3d40496b26a5c8939~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=87c2d249&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=svFnnyEN0cLhKVmTQf%2B3nbtGBr4%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7233369786129286149\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAugxpMiLzcmHRc4nCQzMlQE_3omam9Neex83BUetaxH1JDwMHMeTxnJW-R6nqFgLF\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7598605609155920642\",\n        \"text\": \"sorry, but on some level you knew it wrong. proud of your transparency and everything but yeah.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-23T17:10:44.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 93,\n        \"replyCount\": 19,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"loveyoumost_23\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Shirley Carter\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/4ab295f71035571152b7f8cb9fdeefb6~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=e7eb4c2f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=kdTnG6iMgaLeBT98Qbca4sofEp0%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7096358377966289926\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAA1oEz6yidZ79J35ljFO0p00asfJqO4Xu8UF35CTAoetCqZvsmn8Am_budw4Wp7C-R\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7439582600092402478\",\n        \"text\": \"thank you for this.. 💜 every adult that knew, failed me + the kid who did it to me + every kid that came after. kids deserve better & i appreciate you speaking out and speaking up.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-21T04:20:26.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 30,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"capynaps\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Lord Babybangs Fartquaad\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/e09c0b1b574c6dd2cb4134718dcd8266~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=4536031f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=UXjJrmHzuXJQl6PJ%2Fwi1S7lwSKs%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7132748574544217134\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAA1KWikC9aEgK52GoEG9Ryde1_FOEuO6B748OxrG6B6jTiE6JCLJzOn9g7ggQNGLMM\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7440716696924619563\",\n        \"text\": \"Bless your heart, babe. More people need to be made aware of this. I have experienced this.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-24T05:41:16.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 23,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"flamebbyprincesskitty\",\n          \"displayName\": \"flame bby\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/e53464c42f4b09f82426d5ecea5c1701~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=6f20f000&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=ZL2AiqIpHL73km%2FgRT1rbeM%2ByKI%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7013512267427005445\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAA-phqP6qrffJ61s5rOyNPOFExmxKJUPZygSswjDp29COzbccjFpitPOaynki0QCKj\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7443282696086127403\",\n        \"text\": \"I feel I didn’t even know this was a thing. Not something I hear about ever.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-12-01T03:38:42.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 10,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"joseph_m_yettaw_trautman\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Joseph Michael Yettaw-Trautman\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/d77ff91d8471fcee23d95abce0ba9b26~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=10f560e7&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=QA2AYXyZRzzGze%2B5U5ywDJv%2Fejw%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"6838648242172118022\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAA58e9xYz8s4_ecEWcPSntZ5RqdztQbqIbLGYTVHD0uJcQYInJj57wByzAe_32s1qf\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7456350763616355102\",\n        \"text\": \"You’re so brave. You are well appreciated for your accountability and the way you’re bringing light to this topic. 🩷\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-01-05T08:49:37.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 8,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"sociallyawkwardari_\",\n          \"displayName\": \"￶ ⃟\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/010f5d1fb1ecafa8019cc162c11390e5~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=cdf069e8&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=MIYsabkxE6s%2FQZ7mllGM7mjG288%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7312560134114313259\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAM_cbl0DePV5AeXRWQeulT9cQB7hQk8gdrAoXdptaZ3Vs1XUwyhQZAD_dQF34vBMT\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7449753743791211272\",\n        \"text\": \"Thank you so much for this vulnerability 💖\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-12-18T14:09:25.000Z\",\n        \"likes\": 7,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"language\": \"en\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"tarotcartel\",\n          \"displayName\": \"Cartel Queen\",\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-avt-0068/0816ff25cce884c3d40496b26a5c8939~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=87c2d249&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=svFnnyEN0cLhKVmTQf%2B3nbtGBr4%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"7233369786129286149\",\n          \"secUid\": \"MS4wLjABAAAAugxpMiLzcmHRc4nCQzMlQE_3omam9Neex83BUetaxH1JDwMHMeTxnJW-R6nqFgLF\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"20\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    },\n    \"totalComments\": 123\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_4c770df9-78bb-4442-a659-46c049f1297d\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a9-b441-7ea2-8a86-4fc405ad8891\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","comments":[{"id":"7594535768023499550","text":"I was accused of COCSA. I have zero memory of it. I apologize to the victim and said I apologize for any and all hurt I caused, even if I didn’t remember. This was all as adults, I was forgiven and now years later I’ve been outcasted by family and victim. It’s hard to take accountability for events I have no idea happened or have zero recollection of. My victim has done other bad things to me as well that now has made me okay with the no contact between us. It’s unfortunate but I’m on my own because of actions I have no memory of and already apologized and owned up for. I hope everyone heals","createdAt":"2026-01-12T17:58:08.000Z","likes":421,"replyCount":6,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"kind.ghostie","displayName":"K ✨","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/7352816278739877931~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=702c7dde&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=LlHxiTUjWsWmMGgpJEJC9fVyDCE%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"150909121054019584","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAANg0U5L_ov3RjyeIjk3Hk4rRYEft6Md6uCw6yb9KPVbvC4bpblZNi0WvOianP86eb"}},{"id":"7664479920744448786","text":"I did it to my brother, we were young and I regret it to this day I don’t know why I did it and I will never forgive myself.","createdAt":"2026-07-20T05:36:54.000Z","likes":68,"replyCount":4,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"yogiallyamare","displayName":"yogially","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/11d480f6e02876f4324bd1ed232d8eb7~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=9fcd59ca&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=XfTI8XpTgFWohW7So6n4K0P77gQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7142278874755220486","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAQ5eBDKom9CipWycM8ezDsAT_WXKtrM2m067e9-ktNCfycZxoUm4MVWRcFEuj0GXR"}},{"id":"7577415525601559327","text":"I don’t wanna see any hate to this. She came out and was fully honest. She didn’t say anything to excuse her actions. This is pure honesty. Thank you for sharing your story.","createdAt":"2025-11-27T14:42:40.000Z","likes":373,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"hjdonbnnet6","displayName":"~𝓕𝓘𝓢𝓗𝓨~","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/3c92fe761e78c80e6a0ec36659b43c78~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=aa37c218&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Uwu6DNSz6zLzO%2FO2T3t%2F90sDHb8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7549801577943778359","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAeFwkM3Xh6M6dA0u9vgA_xfBRaTRy7-qhnVjSFo-eZkL8pINTl-PjCODAhULS3V4T"}},{"id":"7439022757432017706","text":"It absolutely amazing that you are taking COMPLETE ACCOUNTABILITY! Thank you so much for that💖 I never received that as a child from the person who touched me. This is everything for survivors 🥰","createdAt":"2024-11-19T16:08:01.000Z","likes":547,"replyCount":1,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"shaaa1994","displayName":"Aysjaaa","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/42a317376ae150cd3a94d32bbd71fa75~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=2acc3f46&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=SvTfutW2In1BzrK5E9piswcuJNw%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"6822723708223669253","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAH71vqwqG-k5qAB0tVFu6ZkOsD1JwVp66uMf2ia1LzhNQt6QwYeQwcSveKATc3rxE"}},{"id":"7664479309230490386","text":"I did it as a child and I have always regretted it deeply and still do I wish I never did it","createdAt":"2026-07-20T05:34:20.000Z","likes":30,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"yogiallyamare","displayName":"yogially","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/11d480f6e02876f4324bd1ed232d8eb7~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=9fcd59ca&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=XfTI8XpTgFWohW7So6n4K0P77gQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7142278874755220486","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAQ5eBDKom9CipWycM8ezDsAT_WXKtrM2m067e9-ktNCfycZxoUm4MVWRcFEuj0GXR"}},{"id":"7439021341892231966","text":"I really appreciate your approach to taking accountability and honesty in sharing this story.","createdAt":"2024-11-19T16:02:24.000Z","likes":232,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"rissssssssssy29","displayName":"evonne💗","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-avt-0068-tx2/d77814f59008589a5f525d8a948b9b94~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=2d30f3cc&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Ei9tDKjIISVpUuEQU90LL%2BLpDY8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7277606189487162410","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAJd25GD3bBdvQWGRw_Si6NSdO3c5jcdTGgCjZn8zpjwA1W8hKF0ShCaO4GfP3cfXC"}},{"id":"7645707485441262366","text":"You are incredibly brave to share something so vulnerable.","createdAt":"2026-05-30T15:30:24.000Z","likes":27,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"emilysherwood5","displayName":"Dr. Emily Sherwood","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/3dfe0cde476b63a612bf673575db4cf5~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=74149b72&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=Bii1PzX7EdEcNyISKVgWF6jf0mo%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7601957658414285838","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAcBKOAJ6PFAj3wHNKIbMTHpTcLhWunLHRiNs4wFB7HhJBO3xE7dWjm-tOi9FoXyCx"}},{"id":"7439083868631122731","text":"Thank you for owning up to this","createdAt":"2024-11-19T20:05:18.000Z","likes":189,"replyCount":1,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"megatronbt","displayName":"JermaineUser2711","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/2a8941426b15c2a34d1d04e8eba4a54c~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=27cb6344&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=DR3lTaauqBY%2BeEl6zVYwgA7NcCA%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"6892994578366907397","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAxqdxducrUqlltzAdtIB5FzP0c_6eXQeLlo_I_5Vy3KBEF3L1_dU9Pna2rI3CcWXj"}},{"id":"7604247109025497869","text":"As a victim of this. Thank you for talking about this, it’s healing.","createdAt":"2026-02-07T22:02:49.000Z","likes":46,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"deboopdeboop7","displayName":"deboopdeboop","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/musically-maliva-obj/1594805258216454~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=c043984f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=N6aGIRwjGaTIxlykkM%2FXo5BweKM%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7511910955473011755","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAARAAhZ65jO5o-LZM2x8kxTWX_JMtDUQYunNnfEpHGlukjvD2jRtk4xl1slLOlCbJa"}},{"id":"7446151894395568928","text":"Thank you for being so open about this. COCSA happened to me, my sis & male cousin by relatives - who denied all knowledge.The 3 of us validating our experiences, speaking to mum & aunt about this","createdAt":"2024-12-08T21:12:31.000Z","likes":108,"replyCount":2,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"andria_bobbles","displayName":"Ria ✨️✨️","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast2a-avt-0068-euttp/5bf44f49503979b1c19ed713813c10bb~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=d2b4fc3c&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=bsVfYLWxhh1zOKBE5GCQx2LRUs8%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"6879814289726735365","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAEiN4ITn3fhdAJ1zItJ86cLd33p_r2mt2dFGsAv4o31iiVYp4Ac0nZVlVwvGryA-K"}},{"id":"7577885012218643231","text":"wow this is deep and the amount of introspection and accountability is refreshing as sad as this all is.","createdAt":"2025-11-28T21:04:37.000Z","likes":101,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"natalieneedsabreak","displayName":"Natalie J.","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/7043990849901821998~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=8cb9d11c&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=N56D%2FjE%2B1Hh74Q5fUqjqbAwnJuQ%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7043990003140199429","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAqYvtLYQ17KAclNLdaFzKFqeRGgih-vKN0k615A4M6a-0ExQlXi96Gh5F-3SxteWt"}},{"id":"7601513554866275093","text":"I was also the one that did it. I was curious I didn't understand, my female friends didn't understand. I didn't intend to cause harm, I only found out years and years later that it was wrong. I apologized to all of them, they apologized to me. We are still friends today.\nAnd I didn't get out of it unscathed, I didn't know my identity for years, I was bi, then omni. Now I am finally okay and I can finally move on, they have moved on. It is not always that this happens on purpose.\nYears later I was also a victim. Unfortunately things like this happen💔","createdAt":"2026-01-31T13:15:06.000Z","likes":110,"replyCount":5,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"amy.as.awesome.as.always","displayName":"Amelia Reneé","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-avt-0068/57efe9d528b2cc9810d876e9d7cd91a5~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=196abccb&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=mRqYzw4fpAGzzsCgpOxZR36DKUA%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"6597445265316134917","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAk69a7OnSCEreVNzHnEV-wQdeC-9t2I6Vq7cEgPOARd8qSilkT5cez8dlmTJYS0G6"}},{"id":"7439111245485966126","text":"I'm sorry that happened to you. it literally ruined my life.","createdAt":"2024-11-19T21:51:16.000Z","likes":62,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"mysticinspires","displayName":"MysticInspirations&Artistry","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/6566a5e32d4a49b327a7874b79788207~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=6278d632&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=AS%2Fnwfpx8jdeAgad9IlsM84miHo%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7401108175481242667","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAyOJ7z5I1T1PGgFCyKmHCB4ZzRyIl3H_RY1bxI328FTqRpa6Zw2lTtA7cumGIbdgi"}},{"id":"7449754128928391943","text":"I will never understand why my mother kept taking me to sleepovers with someone who did this to me. I was never okay afterwards. It is so healing to hear this from you, and I am so, so grateful 💖","createdAt":"2024-12-18T14:10:53.000Z","likes":39,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"tarotcartel","displayName":"Cartel Queen","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-avt-0068/0816ff25cce884c3d40496b26a5c8939~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=87c2d249&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=svFnnyEN0cLhKVmTQf%2B3nbtGBr4%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7233369786129286149","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAugxpMiLzcmHRc4nCQzMlQE_3omam9Neex83BUetaxH1JDwMHMeTxnJW-R6nqFgLF"}},{"id":"7598605609155920642","text":"sorry, but on some level you knew it wrong. proud of your transparency and everything but yeah.","createdAt":"2026-01-23T17:10:44.000Z","likes":93,"replyCount":19,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"loveyoumost_23","displayName":"Shirley Carter","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-maliva-avt-0068/4ab295f71035571152b7f8cb9fdeefb6~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=e7eb4c2f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=kdTnG6iMgaLeBT98Qbca4sofEp0%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7096358377966289926","sec